+      <section class="hero">
+        <h1>One page, two schemes.</h1>
+        <h2>Light by default, dark on request</h2>
+        <p>
+          Duo follows the reader's color-scheme preference. Every token is a CSS
+          variable that a <code>prefers-color-scheme: dark</code> block redefines.
